  "description": "<p><b>⭐ </b><b><i>Twisted Tarot </i></b><i>is coming to London. Step into a show where tarot, mystery, and comedy meet on the same stage. The readings are genuine, and the comedy too. Grab your seat for <b>Twisted Tarot: Where Comedy Meets Fate and the Secrets of Tarot </b>in London!</i><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Highlights</b><br>\r\n🔮 A tarotista and a comedian share the stage in this mystical, hilarious comedy show<br>\r\n🃏 Learn the meaning of tarot and what the cards might reveal about you while having fun<br>\r\n🏺 The audience is part of the show, with volunteers invited on stage for a reading<br>\r\n🍸 One cocktail included to sip while the cards reveal their secrets<br>\r\n✨ Mystical comedy club atmosphere. No tarot knowledge required<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>General Info</b><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n📍 Location: Glaziers Hall, London<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 75 minutes<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 18+<br>\r\n🪑 Seats are assigned upon arrival on a first come first served basis<br>\r\n❓ For more information, please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQDbt021-ECAOcNzbz8g3GrrphTPTXIa_fkszPkLus0BkS1UR27i750hEo3xoEprIKukD0PNwcSXnpP/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Description</b><br>\r\nA deck of cards. A room full of curiosity. Twisted Tarot is an interactive theater show where tarot and comedy meet on the same stage. A professional tarot reader reveals the symbolism and meaning behind the cards while real readings unfold with volunteers from the audience. A comedian reacts to every twist of fate, turning insights and surprises into shared laughter. Come with friends, discover the world of tarot, and see what the cards might reveal. Get your tickets now for Twisted Tarot in London!</p>",
